==Evaluation==
'''Pros'''
*Multiple self-heals in the form of [[life stealing]].
'''Cons'''
*Damage is lacking.
*[[Wallow's Bite]] require Brutus to be in touch range, and his durability is rather low.
*Brutus has a low [[Soul Reaping]] attribute making [[Icy Veins]] and energy management weak.
*Doesn't have [[Blood Ritual]].
*Outside the Raisu Palace and Imperial Sanctum missions, it only has 7 skills equipped.

